# Start this lesson's development server first.
# In a REST-client extension, run each request separately.
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/classrooms/
Accept: application/json

### Create (only in writable lessons; add required authentication)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students/
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Sana","roll":901,"city":"Delhi","classroom":1}

### Partial update (only when a detail endpoint exists)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/students/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{"city":"Agra"}

### Authentication instructions are in README.md and LECTURE_NOTES.md.
